T0
G49 (Assume no offsets at first)
o<open_startline_logfile> call (Opens a named log file depending on start line)
N10 G18 G40 G80 G20 G54 G94
N40 T0101
N60 G00 Z1.5
X2
M3 S600
N70 G1 X0.61 F100
N140 Z1.5
(Start on the next line, should execute only the last two passes)
o<log_modal_state> call (logs modal state at start line for comparison)
N150 Z1.0
(log,at program end)
(log,x_machine: #<_x_machine>)
(log,y_machine: #<_y_machine>)
(log,z_machine: #<_z_machine>)
(log,a_machine: #<_a_machine>)
(log,b_machine: #<_b_machine>)
(log,c_machine: #<_c_machine>)
(log,u_machine: #<_u_machine>)
(log,v_machine: #<_v_machine>)
(log,w_machine: #<_w_machine>)
(Another tool change to see if selected tool / pocket is fixed)
(log,changing to tool 2)
N40 T02
(log,selected_tool: #<_selected_tool>)
(log,selected_pocket: #<_selected_pocket>)
(log,current_tool: #<_current_tool>)
(log,current_pocket: #<_current_pocket>)
(logclose)
M30

